BaiduPCS-GoPlus
https://github.com/wlaog/BaiduPCS-GoPlus

This distribution is based on qjfoidnh/BaiduPCS-Go and the BaiduPCS-Go
work by iikira and other upstream contributors. The GitHub repository
retains the fork lineage of felixonmars/BaiduPCS-Go.

Modifications for BaiduPCS-GoPlus include manual one-way folder
reconciliation, a local browser GUI, directory browsing, safety
confirmations, upload initialization fixes, and release packaging.

